a-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">13.20.13560<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 10, 2023<br/>Summer Update 2023</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230617175240&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bag_You_Covet_31d037.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a bag you covet.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This item is only dropped by bosses in the <a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a>, but can also be obtained via <a href=\"#/wiki/Crimson%20Offering\">Crimson Offerings</a>. Having more <a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore%27s%20Taints\">Bakragore's Taints</a> active will increase the chance of looting one from a boss. \n</p><p>A \"first-kill chance\" exists for this item while fighting <a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore\">Bakragore</a>, which means that when players defeat this boss for the first time, and for as long as they do not drop it, players will have a considerably higher chance to drop it. The chance of dropping it from Bakragore increases every time you kill it and resets to the initial low value whenever it is dropped.\n</p><p>While you can not equip these bags, they are an exception in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopedia\">Bosstiary</a>'s equipment loot bonus, and setting Rotten Blood bosses in the boss slot will increase the chances of looting it.\n</p><p>The bag quickly transforms into another item once the Reward Container it's in is opened. It can be transformed into any of the parts of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sanguine%20Set\">Sanguine Set</a>, but can only transform into a Grand version when fighting Bakragore under the influence of <a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore%27s%20Burden\">Bakragore's Burden</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Grand Sanguine Battleaxe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grand_Sanguine_Battleaxe_599d0a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Grand Sanguine Battleaxe</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\